  "notes": "KANJI: {散|さん} (scatter) + {歩|ほ/ぽ} (walk) = leisurely walk.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {散歩|さんぽ}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {散歩|さんぽ}する: to take a walk\n- {散歩|さんぽ}に{行|い}く: to go for a walk\n- {散歩|さんぽ}に{出|で}かける: to go out for a walk\n- {犬|いぬ}の{散歩|さんぽ}: walking the dog\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {散歩道|さんぽみち}: walking path\n- {散歩|さんぽ}コース: walking course/route\n- {朝|あさ}の{散歩|さんぽ}: morning walk\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {歩|ある}く: to walk (general)\n- ウォーキング: walking (for exercise)\n- {徘徊|はいかい}: wandering (often negative nuance)",
